    "sentence_translations": [
      "(2) She Doesn’t Have an Owner",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo finished work. She was now at the pet store.",
      "",
      "“You finished work quite late today,” Little Liang said.",
      "",
      "“Yes, this week has been so busy,” Qian Duoduo said.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was in the store having a look.",
      "She said, “Last week, there was a big dog here. He’s not here now. Where’s the big dog?”",
      "",
      "Little Liang said, “His owner came back. He and his owner went home.”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo saw a little dog. She asked, “Did this little dog come this week? Where’s her owner?”",
      "",
      "Little Liang said, “I saw her in the school.”",
      "",
      "“She doesn’t have an owner?”",
      "",
      "“I think she doesn’t have an owner. I saw her there three times.”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo looked at the little dog. She was very small.",
      "Qian Duoduo looked at the little dog. The little dog was also looking at her."
    ]
